1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,500
<font color="#FFD700"><b>📍 In Bwari, Godozhi (Kuje), or Ibwa (Gwagwalada)—</b></font>
if a child burns with <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>fever at 11:00 PM</b></font>,

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:15,500
or a pregnant mother <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>starts bleeding</b></font>, what happens
when the <font color="#FFD700"><b>network drops</b></font> and transport costs money?

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Waiting at home is fatal. Going to the wrong clinic wastes time.
And in rural schools, <font color="#00E5FF"><b>when data finishes, learning stops.</b></font>

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,000
🚀 So we built <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Abuja Connect 2.0</b></font>.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,000
We didn't guess from an office in Central Abuja. We went to the field—
conducting baseline & midline engagements in <font color="#FFD700"><b>Godozhi (Kuje)</b></font>,

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:44,000
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Ibwa I & II (Gwagwalada)</b></font>, and across <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Bwari</b></font>—
from Ushafa, Jigo, and Sabon-Gari to Kogo I & II and Dutse.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Mothers, teachers, and CHEWs told us 3 things:
<font color="#FFD700"><b>1. Speak our language</b></font> • <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>2. Instant emergencies</b></font> • <font color="#2FBF71"><b>3. Work without data</b></font>

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:01,500
💚 <font color="#2FBF71"><b>1. MamaCare Triage:</b></font> Confirm consent & pick your language—
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Pidgin, Hausa, Yoruba, Igbo, English, or Gbagyi Audio 🔊</b></font>

9
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:08,500
If a mother taps a danger sign like <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>heavy bleeding or convulsions</b></font>,
our emergency circuit-breaker interrupts the form immediately:

10
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:14,500
🚨 <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>RED ALERT — Go NOW to Bwari General Hospital</b></font>
while alerting the CHEW on duty!

11
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:19,500
⚠️ <font color="#FFD700"><b>2 Symptoms = YELLOW:</b></font> Go today to
<font color="#FFD700"><b>Ushafa PHC or Kogo PHC</b></font> (Bwari Area Council).

12
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:25,000
📱 No smartphone? Dial <font color="#FFD700"><b>*384*725#</b></font> on any torchlight phone!

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:33,500
🆘 Live <font color="#00E5FF"><b>FCT Emergency Directory (112)</b></font> sorts ambulances,
police posts & hospitals by GPS across all <font color="#2FBF71"><b>6 Area Councils</b></font>.

14
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:43,000
📚 <font color="#00E5FF"><b>2. Bwari Learn:</b></font> In wards like Kawu where attendance drops,
pupils download once on WiFi and <font color="#FFD700"><b>learn 100% OFFLINE</b></font>.

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:53,500
✨ GenAI turns 1 topic into 4 local assets: a 10-min visual lesson—
like <font color="#FFA500"><b>Primary 5 Fractions sharing 3 oranges in Ushafa market 🍊</b></font>—

16
00:01:53,500 --> 00:02:04,500
an interactive <font color="#2FBF71"><b>3-question quiz</b></font>, automated <font color="#FFD700"><b>Parent SMS</b></font>,
and a <font color="#00E5FF"><b>Teacher Dashboard</b></font> flagging who needs help tomorrow.

17
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:14,500
✅ <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Field Proof:</b></font> In silent usability trials with mothers, pupils & CHEWs,
<font color="#FFD700"><b>8 out of 10 mothers</b></font> completed triage with zero help!

18
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:20,500
📈 And pupils boosted their scores after the localized
<font color="#00E5FF"><b>Pidgin and English fraction lesson.</b></font>

19
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:31,500
🛠️ When fast tappers hit a <font color="#FF4D4D"><b>900ms button delay</b></font> in field testing,
we re-engineered the UI, added <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Zod server validation</b></font> & shipped the fix!

20
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:38,000
🤝 We are <font color="#FFD700"><b>engineers, data scientists, CHEWs & educators</b></font>
building from the ground up in the FCT.

21
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:45,500
🚀 With <font color="#00E5FF"><b>USPF Changemaker</b></font> support, we will integrate live USSD gateways
and scale across <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Bwari, Kuje & Gwagwalada in 60 days.</b></font>

22
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:53,500
💚 <font color="#2FBF71"><b>Abuja Connect 2.0:</b></font> Life-saving triage & offline learning—
<font color="#FFD700"><b>in our language, without data wahala!</b></font>
